 "text": "Hi, how have you been? You were thinking big goal that lines up with your energy level. How are you feeling now? Of course. Talk to her when I' gone. Start in the lake district and cut across the fells. It did get compacted though, so it's not as wide as it should be. It needs a good airing out anyway. Did you pack it in a bag or on top of the bike? Sure, go ahead. Okay, fine. In the lake district, cutting across the fells. You want push yourself, but not hurt yourself. Stick to routes you' familiar with, and pick nights when it's still light most of the way. A good headlamp and warm layers are your friends.",
